{
    "id":  26703,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "6W Fire Rated Recessed LED Downlight Dimmable TRIAC 3CCT IP65 36° | White",
    "reference":  "91582-PACK60",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e6W fireproof recessed LED downlight in white\u003c/strong\u003e, with high-efficiency SMD2835 LED \u003cstrong\u003e(130 lm/W) and selectable 3CCT (3000K, 4000K and 6000K)\u003c/strong\u003e. \u003cstrong\u003eDimmable TRIAC DOB driver \u003c/strong\u003eNo Flicker for smooth intensity control. \u003cstrong\u003eWith front IP65, rear IP20\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003e36\u003c/strong\u003e° beam angle, it is ideal for bathrooms and damp areas. \u003cstrong\u003eComplies with EN1363-1\u003c/strong\u003e and offers maximum safety. Ø88x38 mm, cut-out Ø68-75 mm, perfect for renovations and professional LED installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e\nFireproof Recessed LED Downlight 6W | 3CCT TRIAC\n\n\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e6W Fireproof Recessed LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is a professional solution for \u003cstrong\u003eindoor LED lighting\u003c/strong\u003e projects that require safety, efficiency and flexibility. It features high-efficiency \u003cstrong\u003eSMD2835 technology (130 lm/W)\u003c/strong\u003e, delivering powerful illumination with low consumption, while its fireproof design adds an extra level of safety in recessed installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT\u003c/strong\u003e system lets you choose between \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K and 6000K\u003c/strong\u003e —warm, natural or cool light— directly during installation, making it easy to adapt the same luminaire to different environments and needs without having to keep several models in stock.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTRIAC dimming and visual comfort\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe downlight incorporates a \u003cstrong\u003edimmable No Flicker TRIAC DOB driver\u003c/strong\u003e, compatible with TRIAC dimmers to smoothly adjust the light intensity according to the needs of the space. \u003cstrong\u003eNo Flicker\u003c/strong\u003e technology helps provide more comfortable and stable lighting, especially valuable in installations where visual comfort is a priority.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e36° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e provides a precise, directed light distribution, suitable for illuminating specific areas and creating decorative or architectural effects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFireproof safety and IP65 protection\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of its main differentiators is its \u003cstrong\u003efireproof\u003c/strong\u003e construction, especially suitable for recessed installations where fire safety is an important factor. The product \u003cstrong\u003ecomplies with the EN1363-1 standard\u003c/strong\u003e, providing additional assurance for professional projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt offers \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 protection on the front and IP20 on the rear\u003c/strong\u003e, making it particularly appropriate for \u003cstrong\u003ebathrooms and damp indoor areas\u003c/strong\u003e, always taking the installation conditions into account. Its \u003cstrong\u003eiron and plastic\u003c/strong\u003e construction provides strength and durability for long-term use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts dimensions of \u003cstrong\u003eØ88 x 38 mm\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003ecut-out diameter of Ø68-75 mm\u003c/strong\u003e make it easy to install in a range of existing openings, making it an especially practical solution for \u003cstrong\u003erenovations and recessed luminaire replacements\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for LED lighting projects in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBathrooms and washrooms\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDamp indoor areas\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHomes and apartments\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHotels and hospitality spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCorridors and common areas\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRenovations and refurbishments\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional LED lighting projects\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003e6W Fireproof Recessed LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e combines \u003cstrong\u003e130 lm/W, selectable 3CCT, No Flicker TRIAC dimming, front IP65 and EN1363-1 compliance\u003c/strong\u003e in a compact, safe luminaire. A versatile solution that reduces consumption, simplifies stock and delivers an excellent \u003cstrong\u003ereturn on investment (ROI)\u003c/strong\u003e in professional installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
